            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DEIDRA1"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I customize it a little bit by adding a little more brown sugar (we like it sweeter). But I've made it as the recipe states and it's perfectly yummy, too. How I make it just depends on what we're having it with. Those in my family who loves sweet potatoes love this recipe.",
